span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:nowrap;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16.8px;white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0.642em;min-height:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">σ<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;min-height:1px;width:0.023em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-size:8.4px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">η</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:nowrap;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">)</span><br><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:nowrap;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\"></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:nowrap;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:nowrap;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">I want to understand the default prior for </span><span style=\"font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic;font-size:16.8px;white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">σ</span><span style=\"font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic;font-size:11.8776px;white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">η.</span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;box-sizing:border-box\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;line-height:normal;word-spacing:normal;white-space:nowrap;float:none;direction:ltr;max-width:none;max-height:none;min-width:0px;min-height:0px\"><u></u><span role=\"math\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:1.089em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0.893em;min-height:0px;font-size:16.8px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:2.202em\"></span></span></span><span style=\"border-left-style:solid;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.425em;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;width:0px;min-height:1.01em\"></span></span><u></u></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><div>It appears from <a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#sec:priors\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,122,183)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23sec:priors&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441576585000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2N_K2zvhvVf53AE6tw8PWV\">here</a> and the below that the default prior for the <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12.6px;padding:2px 4px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border-radius:4px;white-space:pre\">log precision</code> (<br></div></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;line-height:normal;word-spacing:normal;white-space:nowrap;float:none;direction:ltr;max-width:none;max-height:none;min-width:0px;min-height:0px\"><u></u><span role=\"math\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:5.661em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:4.702em;min-height:0px;font-size:16.8px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;padding-left:0.313em;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">log</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">/</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:1.019em;min-height:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">σ<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;min-height:1px;width:0.033em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">η</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Regular\">)</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:2.5em\"></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;border-left-style:solid;vertical-align:-0.422em;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;width:0px;min-height:1.481em\"></span></span><u></u></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">) is </span><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12.6px;padding:2px 4px;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border-radius:4px;white-space:pre\">loggamma</code><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">:</span><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">inla.models()$latent$iid$hyper$theta$name</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">## [1] &quot;log precision&quot;\r\n## attr(,&quot;inla.read.only&quot;)\r\n## [1] FALSE</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">inla.models()$latent$iid$hyper$theta$prior</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">## [1] &quot;loggamma&quot;\r\n## attr(,&quot;inla.read.only&quot;)\r\n## [1] FALSE</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">inla.models()$latent$iid$hyper$theta$param</code></pre><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">## [1] 1e+00 5e-05\r\n## attr(,&quot;inla.read.only&quot;)\r\n## [1] FALSE</code></pre></div><div><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></code></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">The parametrization is described </span><a href=\"https://inla.r-inla-download.org/r-inla.org/doc/prior/prior-loggamma.pdf\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,122,183);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://inla.r-inla-download.org/r-inla.org/doc/prior/prior-loggamma.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441576585000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CQY14FMo5KTB9a83W7Td_\">here</a><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/attach/5c67188a28882/INLA_loggamma_parametrization.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"INLA_loggamma_parametrization.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></span></div><div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:10px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Drawing from the prior for <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit\"></span><span role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;line-height:normal;word-spacing:normal;white-space:nowrap;float:none;direction:ltr;max-width:none;max-height:none;min-width:0px;min-height:0px\"><u></u><span role=\"math\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:1.089em\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0.893em;min-height:0px;font-size:16.8px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0.908em;min-height:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">σ<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;min-height:1px;width:0.033em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;font-size:11.8776px;font-family:STIXGeneral-Italic\">η</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:3.988em\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;vertical-align:0px;line-height:normal;width:0px;min-height:2.202em\"></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;border-left-style:solid;vertical-align:-0.425em;line-height:normal;overflow:hidden;width:0px;min-height:1.01em\"></span></span><u></u></span></span> gives:</p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;padding:9.5px;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.42857;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">precision_s = rgamma(n = <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1000</span>, shape = <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1</span>, rate = <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">0.00005</span>)\r\nsigma_eta_s = <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">1</span>/sqrt(precision_s)\r\nggplot(tibble(sigma_eta_s), aes(x=sigma_eta_s)) + geom_histogram()</code></pre><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/attach/5c67188a28882/Screen%20Shot%202019-09-19%20at%202.03.43%20PM.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-09-19 at 2.03.43 PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"288\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Is this correct?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Thanks so much!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Shira</p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
