   "subject": "Re: [r-inla] default prior for log precision hyperparameter",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "seems like it. the prior is defined for \r<br>\r<br>log(precision)\r<br>\r<br>and for precision, its Gamma(...) .\r<br>\r<br>I would not take these default choices for &#39;being good&#39; and for most\r<br>models we prefer the PC-priors, which is exponential for the stdev. \r<br>\r<br>Best\r<br>H\r<br>"
    ],
    [
